WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
In Arrange by All pages, select a page.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.200
Add nearby pages to the selection so the page cards can move together.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.800
Drag the selected group towards a new gap in the page order.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.330
Drop at the blue insertion line. The selected pages keep their order.
